If you have a bunch of daggers (which you do), you can drop a certain
number of them by doing d # a (drops # things from slot a) or D, click
on the item and then type the number. Then what you do is pick up
stuff to get right below burdened, pick up the item and then see how
many daggers you have to drop to get unburdened again. Some things are
lighter than a dagger but most are heavier. Zorkmids are even lighter,
if you want more accuracy. all scrolls weight the same, and so on, but
different tools, or weapons or armor will have to be weighted
separately. You can collect your list that way. I can give you my list
of dagger-weights if you'd like. Should be fairly spoiler free.

When playing that wizard I was running around at the point that a
scroll would make me burdened. Not exactly fun, but a good learning
